e online leaderboards. It\u2019s just what the doctor ordered\u2026even if it\u2019s a little late!", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dr-luigi", "videos": [{"id": 1843, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "knZFneOkUqY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=knZFneOkUqY", "title": "Dr. Luigi - Trailer (Wii U)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/knZFneOkUqY/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 603, "name": "Dr. Mario"}]}